<title>AUSTRIA: Austria currency reserves up 3.2 pct in December.</title>
<headline>Austria currency reserves up 3.2 pct in December.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian foreign currency reserves rose 3.2 percent to 199.303 billion schillings in December, the National Bank said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
